"Rosa Grove Mall is the largest shopping center on Anesidora, with hundreds of stores."
"It has four floors around an atrium whose glass roof panels open to the sky."
"It closes at midnight and has luxury brand stores and a Brutes-only gym nearby."
"A slide wide enough for five riders runs from the fourth floor to the ground, trailing light."
"Its fountain is a knee-deep scale model of Anesidora, with tiny waves matching the ocean."
"A purple beam marks 'You Are Here' over the model mall; kiosks sell coins to toss in."
"Leaving without tossing a coin in the fountain is said to be bad luck."
"A store by the fountain sells alien imports: Tmithan scent stools, bug lamps and rock creatures."
"An athletic supply store is on the fourth floor, and a Filipino restaurant on the third."
"A food hall is downstairs, and ads for language academies line the side entrances."
"Alden's hero class celebrated there after their first week with Filipino food."
